Temporary installation for testing (from https://extensionworkshop.com/documentation/develop/temporary-installation-in-firefox/)

  1. Go to about:debugging#/runtime/this-firefox
  2. Click "Load Temporary Add-on"
  3. Select the .xpi file from the target/ directory

Debugging: https://extensionworkshop.com/documentation/develop/debugging/

Signing: https://addons.mozilla.org/developers/addons
